    <string name="terms_title">Welcome to My Notes</string>
    <string name="terms_intro">Before you start, here is a short summary of the terms and privacy:</string>
    <string name="terms_p1">Your notes are yours alone: they are kept on your device and synced to your own Firebase account, and nobody else can see them.</string>
    <string name="terms_p2">Your Google account is only used to sign you in and tell your notes apart.</string>
    <string name="terms_p3">We do not sell your data or share it with anyone.</string>
    <string name="terms_p4">You are responsible for what you write, and you can delete your notes or all your data at any time from Settings.</string>
    <string name="terms_foot">By tapping “I agree” you accept the terms and the privacy policy.</string>
